WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.960
<i>Not only those inside the Palace of Versailles,</i>

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:19.450
<i>but all of France and the entirety
of Europe's attention,</i>

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:25.300
<i>was focused on Antoinette and Madame
du Barry's rivalry, which was reaching its peak.</i>

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.300
<i>At the time, the French court had a custom,</i>

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:33.380
<i>that forbade a person of lower rank to
address someone of a higher rank first.</i>

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:37.350
<i>As Madame du Barry was once a prostitute who rose through the ranks,</i>

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:42.420
<i>Antoinette has refused
to address Madame du Barry.</i>

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:50.630
<i>I can control even the King,
yet if you insist on defying me,</i>

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:53.100
<i>I'll make you regret it dearly!</i>

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.400
<i>Even if it's His Majesty's order,</i>

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:59.270
<i>I'll never speak a single word
to a prostitute or mistress!</i>

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:04.000
<i>I am the honorable Dauphine of France!</i>

